window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>They say that messing with fate is a dangerous game.</p> <p>But I chose to play it.</p> <p>When I find out that my fated mate is the warrior that hates me and my kind, I make a decision; I hide the bond.</p> <p>Big mistake.</p> <p>Now I have to watch as he gives himself to everyone.</p> <p>Everyone except me.</p> <p>And when the truth comes out, will our worlds ever be the same again?</p> <p><b>This is book three in the Fated Love Series.</b></p> <p>Book 1: <i>Forewarned</i></p> <p>Book 2: <i>Foretold</i></p>"; 
